     1,
     "Dear all,\r<br>\r<br>here&#39;s something of quick guide for fitting static occupancy models in unmarked, taken from the AHM1 book (Kery &amp; Royle, Academic Press, 2016). If you follow this, you should be able to fit your models.\r<br>\r<br>Best regards  ---- Marc\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>\r<br>________________________________________\r<br>From: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a> [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>] on behalf of Angie Escamilla [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">angie.carl...@gmail.com</a>]\r<br>Sent: 07 July 2019 16:25\r<br>To: unmarked\r<br>Subject: [unmarked] Re: Error in unmarked occupancy model\r<br>\r<br>Thanks for the response Rusby! I&#39;ve attached the detection history csv file I used.\r<br>\r<br>--\r<br>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;unmarked&quot; group.\r<br>To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unmarked+u...@googlegroups.com</a>&lt;mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unmarked+u...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;.\r<br>To view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/e101858e-2544-427e-ad10-1d79e7535086%40googlegroups.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/e101858e-2544-427e-ad10-1d79e7535086%2540googlegroups.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450971100000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1RBj_W0DN2fpaSEnaf6YjI\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/e101858e-2544-427e-ad10-1d79e7535086%40googlegroups.com</a>&lt;<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/unmarked/e101858e-2544-427e-ad10-1d79e7535086%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://group