     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">Angie,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"> Are you using RStudio? If so, try making the plot window bigger (taller and/or wider). I&#39;m guessing you have made the coding window big so you can see all the lines, but this makes the plot area too small to display the requested graph(s).</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\">Hope that helps!<br>Rob</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:tahoma,sans-serif\"><br></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\">** See where birds are <a href=\"http://bto.org/mapstore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bto.org/mapstore&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450971103000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0p_Oliq9GjWXOxmGEgXJpN\">bto.org/mapstore</a> and recent changes <a href=\"http://bto.org/birdtrends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bto.org/birdtrends&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450971103000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26qDnaxxiujiZ2PdLvi3r0\">bto.org/birdtrends</a> ***<br><br><div>Dr Rob Robinson, Associate Director - Research<br>Hon Reader: Univ East Anglia | Visiting Researcher: Swiss Ornithological Institute<br>British Trust for Ornithology, The Nunnery, Thetford, Norfolk, IP24 2PU<br>Ph: <a href=\"tel:+44%201842%20750050\" value=\"+441842750050\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+44 (0)1842 750050</a>       T: @btorobrob<br>E: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rob.ro...@bto.org</a>      W: <a href=\"http://www.bto.org/about-bto/our-staff/rob-robinson\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"